The Sentinez Logo

=======================================================================

Section 1 -- Color.

    a. The Sentinez logo has official blue color. When reproducing 
    the logo, please use the official color, when possible

    b. When used digitally, the official RGB color code is #0504aa 
    (HEX: #0504aa, RGB: rgba(5, 4, 170), HSL: hsl(240, 95, 34))

